{"id":"wb-3-233","name":"长陵","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"长陵站 (咸铜铁路)","text":"长陵站是位于陕西省咸阳市渭城区窑店街道的一个铁路车站，邮政编码712000。车站建于1940年，有咸铜铁路经过该站，现仅办理货运，不办理客运业务，车站及其上下行区间均已电气化。车站距离咸阳站10公里，隶属西安铁路局，是四等站。该站因邻近汉高祖刘邦的陵寝长陵而得名，距其约9.2公里。西安地铁14号线长陵站傍其而建。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%95%BF%E9%99%B5%E7%AB%99_(%E5%92%B8%E9%93%9C%E9%93%81%E8%B7%AF)","revisionId":94853176,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94853176","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/5ee6d0591ba0baa2480323ba.jpg","title":"7001在长陵站附近_05.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:7001%E5%9C%A8%E9%95%BF%E9%99%B5%E7%AB%99%E9%99%84%E8%BF%91_05.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ac/7001%E5%9C%A8%E9%95%BF%E9%99%B5%E7%AB%99%E9%99%84%E8%BF%91_05.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Liuxingy","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​7001在咸阳市渭城区长陵站附近","width":320,"height":240}}